      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and attentive salon staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of pet owners praise groomers like Hannah, Daniel, and Genesis alongside front desk team member Stephanie for their friendly and attentive service. Clients value how staff listen to specific cut requests and answer questions without pressure. A couple of reviewers felt staff were dismissive when issues arose or when appointments became difficult."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Stylish cuts alongside uneven trims"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients are delighted with breed-specific grooming, praising neat poodle haircuts, shiny coats, and tidy de-shedding treatments. Owners of doodles and long-haired pets frequently leave glowing remarks. On the other hand, a few reviewers reported unsatisfactory outcomes, including missed ear trimming, dirty ears, and unfinished styling on senior animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight gentle care for nervous dogs, cats, and senior animals. Reviewers appreciate that groomers allow owners of anxious pets to assist or stay nearby to help keep them calm during baths. Clients note that timid pets generally leave the salon relaxed, though one owner noted difficulties managing a senior dog with arthritis."
      }
    }
  ],
